// ************** MOS-MUSIC OpenHymnal ABC → JPW-ABC 1.0 **************\n// source = sources/openhymnal/OpenHymnal2014.06.abc\n// match = exact title match from content/production/tune-matching.json\n\n.Title\nTitle = 我灵镇静（Be Still, My Soul）\nKeyAndMeters = {1=F,4/4}\nWordsByAndMusicBy = Words: Katharina A. von Schlegel, 1752.  Translated by Jane L. Borthwick, 1855.\nMusic: 'Finlandia' Jean Sibelius, 1899.  Setting: from Jean Sibelius, 1900.\ncopyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2008 Revision.\nExpression = {♩=100}\n\n.Voice\n4 2 4 | #4.- 4 | 2 4 1. 2_ | 2 4.- | 4 4 2 4 | #4.- 4 | 2 4 1. 2_ | 4--- | 4 5 5 5 | 6.- 4 | 4 5 5. 2_ | 2 #4.- | #4 #4 4 2 | 4.- 1 | 1 2 2. 4_ | 4--- | 4 5 5 5 | 6.- 4 | 4 5 5. 2_ | 2 #4.- | #4 #4 4 2 | 4.- 1 | 1 2 2. 1_ | 1--- | 1 |\n\n.Words\nW1@1,1:\n{Be} {still,} {my} {soul:} {the} {Lord} {is} {on} {thy} {side.} / / {Bear} {pa} {tient} {ly} {the} {cross} {of} {grief} {or} {pain.} / {Leave} {to} {thy} {God} {to} {or} {der} {and} {pro} {vide;} / / {In} {ev} {ery} {change,} {He} {faith} {ful} {will} {re} {main.} / {Be} {still,} {my} {soul:} {thy} {best,} {thy} {heav'n} {ly} {Friend} / / {Through} {thorn} y {ways} {leads} {to} a {joy} {ful} {end.} /\n